;;This preview is one of EIGHT in the AQP family that ABORT on a probe id — it reads
;;`UR_SCR|ScoreOwnerKonto` eagerly (`02_SCORE.pact:2611`), so an unknown score dies inside the
;;PREVIEW rather than the exec. Six of its siblings are already pinned as findings in
;;`[6.5]_AQP-INFO.repl`; this one was not, and a real id is what makes it measurable at all.
