;;
;;THIS WAS FILED AS "NO FIXTURE" AND THE LABEL WAS WRONG. `UEV_SetCommonDenominatorContext`
;;(`05_FVT.pact:2119`) demands THREE things at once — farm (class 0), `can-upgrade` true, and ZERO
;;ScoreEntityLink rows — and no standing FVT in this chain satisfies all three, because
