;;metadata and requires `(contains trait-key meta-data)` — so the key is `"Rarity"`, capital R, as
;;the Bloodshed minter writes it (`01_BSD-L.pact:297`). A lower-case "rarity" fails with a message
;;listing key, value, score AND precision, none of which is the thing that was wrong.
