;;NAMED BY A SHAPE-CHECK IN `Kursan/aqp-info-tests.repl`, NEVER WEIGHED — see `REPL/tools/_info_measured.py`.
;;THREE VIRGIN SCORES, same class and same owner — the triplet guard (`02_SCORE.pact:925`) wants
